-- en: "Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."
L["Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."] = "Сравнивает число наложений подходящего эффекта, включая заряды, например у Щита земли. Отсутствующий эффект не удовлетворяет этому условию; нечитаемое число недоступно."
-- en: "Only consider debuffs returned by the game's dispellable aura filter. This does not guarantee your dispel is ready or in range."
